---Create Embed Session
---
---Mint an embed session token for one of your sub-merchants, to hand to an
---embedded onboarding iframe. Requires an ADMIN API key and the
---`x-coinflow-submerchant-id` header naming a child or grandchild merchant.
---
---Each token is valid for 15 minutes. The iframe renews it itself through
---`POST /embed/session/refresh`; renewals stop 8 hours after this mint, at
---which point a new token must be minted here.
---
---`parentOrigin` is the origin of the page that frames the iframe. It must
---be covered by one of the whitelisted URLs, and the iframe posts its
---onboarding events only to this origin. Omit it to mint a link-only
---session: the sub-merchant opens the page directly instead of in an
---iframe, and the page refuses to load when framed.
---
---`returnUrl` is where a sub-merchant who opened the page as a link goes
---back to after submitting. It must be covered by one of the whitelisted
---URLs.
---
---`POST /embed/session`
